<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= @page.title %> - <%= @site.title %></title>
  <%= render_partial("head.html", assigns) %>
</head>
<body>
  <%= render_partial("nav.html", assigns) %>
  <%
    repo_url = "https://github.com/platform-q-ai/inkling-mini-5090"
    posts_collection = Map.get(@collections || %{}, "posts")
    posts = if posts_collection, do: posts_collection.pages, else: []
    sorted_posts = Enum.sort_by(posts, &(&1.date), {:desc, DateTime})
    recipe = Enum.find(posts, fn p -> String.contains?(p.url || "", "inkling-2-mini-rtx-5090-recipe") end)
    recipe_href = if recipe, do: String.trim_leading(recipe.url, "/"), else: "posts/index.html"
  %>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Platform Q · Open inference engineering</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Big models, small hardware, <span class="hero-em">measured honestly.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Open inference engineering for the agentic era: what we built, what worked, and what didn't.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="feature wrap" aria-labelledby="feature-title">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-text">
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-accent">Open source · Apache-2.0</p>
          <h2 id="feature-title">Inkling 2 Mini on one RTX 5090</h2>
          <p>We've optimised Thinking Machines Lab's 26B looped mixture-of-experts model on a single consumer GPU for long-running agentic tasks and coding: a set of vLLM patches, with every result and how we measured it.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="<%= recipe_href %>">Read the recipe</a>
            <a class="button" href="<%= repo_url %>" rel="noopener noreferrer">Code on GitHub<span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stats-block">
        <dl class="stats">
          <div class="stat">
            <dt>Decode step</dt>
            <dd><span class="stat-value">5.69<span class="stat-unit">ms</span></span><span class="stat-note">4 concurrent sequences, FP8 KV cache</span></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <dt>Max context</dt>
            <dd><span class="stat-value">344k<span class="stat-unit">tokens</span></span><span class="stat-note">380k-token KV cache pool</span></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <dt>Four agents at once</dt>
            <dd><span class="stat-value">~670<span class="stat-unit">tok/s total</span></span><span class="stat-note">4 agents at 90k context each</span></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <dt>Single stream</dt>
            <dd><span class="stat-value">340<span class="stat-unit">tok/s</span></span><span class="stat-note">on code; 330 on JSON, 253 on prose</span></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <dt>Power draw</dt>
            <dd><span class="stat-value">~430<span class="stat-unit">W</span></span><span class="stat-note">RTX 5090, 4 agents running</span></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <dt>GPU temperature</dt>
            <dd><span class="stat-value">~65<span class="stat-unit">°C</span></span><span class="stat-note">RTX 5090, 4 agents running</span></dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <p class="stats-footnote">All speeds at temperature 1.0, the model's default sampling (not greedy).</p>
        </div>

        <figure class="minichart" aria-labelledby="minichart-cap">
          <figcaption id="minichart-cap">Four concurrent agent streams, total tok/s with all four decoding, by context per stream</figcaption>
          <ul class="minichart-rows">
            <li><span class="minichart-label">~10k</span><span class="minichart-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="minichart-bar" style="width: 92%"></span></span><span class="minichart-value">~920</span></li>
            <li><span class="minichart-label">~90k</span><span class="minichart-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="minichart-bar" style="width: 67%"></span></span><span class="minichart-value">~670</span></li>
          </ul>
        </figure>

        <section class="spec" aria-labelledby="spec-title">
          <h3 id="spec-title">Precision</h3>
          <p class="spec-note">DSpark drafter: 3 layers, proposes 7 tokens.</p>
          <dl class="spec-list">
            <div><dt>Routed MoE experts</dt><dd>NVFP4, as shipped in the checkpoint; layers 20–23 in MXFP8</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Attention projections, all 24 layers (fused qkv and output)</dt><dd>FP8 E4M3 weights with per-row scales; activations FP8 per-token in prefill (W8A8), BF16 in decode</dd></div>
            <div><dt>LM head, shared with the drafter</dt><dd>FP8 E4M3</dd></div>
            <div><dt>DSpark drafter attention (qkv, context kv, output) and MLP (gate-up, down)</dt><dd>FP8 E4M3</dd></div>
            <div><dt>DSpark drafter 16,384-token draft head and Markov head</dt><dd>BF16</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Embeddings, router, loop gates, norms, short convolutions</dt><dd>BF16</dd></div>
            <div><dt>KV cache</dt><dd>FP8</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="writing wrap" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="writing-title">Writing</h2>
        <a class="section-link" href="posts/index.html">All posts <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <%= if sorted_posts == [] do %>
        <p class="empty">No posts yet.</p>
      <% else %>
        <ol class="post-list">
          <%= for post <- sorted_posts do %>
            <%
              href = String.trim_leading(post.url || "", "/")
              fm = post.frontmatter || %{}
              intro = fm["intro"] || fm["description"] || ""
              category = fm["category"]
            %>
            <li class="post-row">
              <div class="post-row-meta">
                <%= if post.date do %><time datetime="<%= Calendar.strftime(post.date, "%Y-%m-%d") %>"><%= Calendar.strftime(post.date, "%d %b %Y") %></time><% end %>
                <%= if category do %><span class="post-row-cat"><%= category %></span><% end %>
              </div>
              <div class="post-row-body">
                <h3><a href="<%= href %>"><%= post.title %></a></h3>
                <%= if intro != "" do %><p><%= intro %></p><% end %>
              </div>
            </li>
          <% end %>
        </ol>
      <% end %>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%= render_partial("footer.html", assigns) %>
</body>
</html>
